The bug was likely introduced due to a git upload conflict that was not properly resolved, leading to inconsistencies in the handling of RDH and RAH cryptographic modes in the user dialog. This resulted in incorrect settings being applied when users interacted with the RDH version combo box, potentially causing the application to behave unexpectedly or fail to send the correct keys.

